notes.mediaTakeaways:
- The longest lifecycle for a SynGas ad on Facebook is 25 days in the US;
- All angles are extremely aggressive and clickbaiting, focusing on conspiracy theories;
- Most popular geo is the United States;
- Germany is the 2nd most popular geo;
- UK is the 3rd most popular geo;
- France is the 4th most popular geo.

- The longest lifecycle for a SynGas ad on Native is 28 days in Germany;
- Same geos are the most popular on Native;
- Same clickbaiting angles are the most popular on Native;
- A different advertorial is running on Native;
- Outbrain, Taboola and MGID are equally big on Native.

- Hundreds of different ads are running on both Native and Facebook.

